window.products.push({"id":993020,"name":"Dremun Premium Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with Table Stand, Brushed Stainless Steel, Adjustable Coarseness, Easy to Fill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrJRgGbNL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","description":"Whether they’re for everyday use or you’re entertaining guests, every home should be equipped with kitchen essentials that will take your dining experience to the next level in style! DREMUN’S SALT & PEPPER GRINDERS ARE THE PERFECT MARRIAGE OF QUALITY & STYLE! At Dremun we understand the importance of quality kitchen staples that last a long time and can perform in everyday situations and during special occasions. That’s why we have designed our salt & pepper shakers with your convenience in mind. These grinders feature several key features that will make life in the kitchen easier and is sure to impress company. FEATURES:• Set of 2• Brushed Stainless Steel• Adjustable Coarseness• Matching Stand• Easy Refilling• 5 Inches• Makes A Great Gift The sleek & stylish design of this salt & pepper grinder set is perfect for just about any home and occasion. The brushed stainless steel complements any kitchen or dining room decor and will match any color scheme during special occasions. The matching stand ensures that it stays upright and doesn’t fall or create annoying messes or spills. SAY GOODBYE TO ANNOYING MESSES & SPILLS Our salt and pepper mills were designed to keep your spices where they belong. The transparent bodies on these shakers allow you to know when it’s time to refill and the wide opening allows for easy & mess free refills. Keep your salt & pepper in the grinders and on your food, where they belong! CUSTOMIZE YOUR DINING EXPERIENCE WITH THE ADJUSTABLE COARSENESS FEATURE! Our salt & pepper crushers have a knob that allows you to dispense fine or coarse seasoning depending on what you and your guests are in the mood for.Whatever the occasion Dremun’s Salt & Pepper Grinders have you covered. Pick up your pair today and add a little spice to your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrJRgGbNL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dremun","source_asin":"B01L9KF4PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L9KF4PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L9KF4PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993021,"name":"Justice League Wonder Woman Gauntlet Clash Statue - Exclusive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B8sdvprBL._AC_.jpg","description":"\"Never let your guard down. You expect the battle to be fair. A battle will never be fair\" (Antiope, Wonder Woman). That's the scene just before Diana realizes what her gauntlets can do. We might not know exactly what they're going to do, but we know it'll be good. At this point, though, we have more knowledge more than the character herself does, which is fun. It's the sort of pride we have as a child discovers the world: new creature, you have no idea what you're capable of. Well, technically, this one's a statue, so it ain't going to be capable of much. Perhaps if you put it in your lobby, it can fend off solicitors? Tiny ones, at least. And it can hold your paperwork in place like a champ. Limited to a single run of 1500, this statue from Icon Heroes is hand numbered and comes with a Certificate of Authenticity. So act now if you want to save the tiny world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B8sdvprBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonder Woman","source_asin":"B07DV62XSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DV62XSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DV62XSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
