window.products.push({"id":993045,"name":"Bush Furniture Key West Bookcase Shelf | Open Bookcase in Dark Gray Hickory | Farmhouse Display Cabinet for Library, Bedroom, Living Room, Office | Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":220.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fqCgwzHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the perfect addition to your home decor: the sleek and stylish tall bookcase. This mid century bookshelf is designed to not only store your favorite books but also to display your cherished mementos and decorative items. With five spacious shelves, you can organize your books by genre or author, and even leave room for additional items. Don't settle for an ordinary bookshelf; choose the Bush Furniture wooden bookshelf and elevate your home library to the next level. Key features: The mid century modern bookshelf is a versatile storage solution that lets you showcase your favorite artwork, photos, plants, and more. Three adjustable shelves and two fixed shelves provide ample space to accommodate items of various sizes, while each shelf can support up to 50 pounds, making it perfect for storing paperback and hardcover books or displaying decorations with confidence. The unique X pattern accents on the side panels and the sturdy and attractive post leg design add a touch of style and elegance to the wooden bookshelf, making it a perfect choice for homes that embrace cottage, coastal, and farmhouse decor. Measuring 32W x 13D x 66H, this 5 tier storage shelves are an ideal fit for any home office or living room and includes wall attachment hardware for added safety and security. This corner bookshelf is tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty, ensuring that you can enjoy your new bookshelf for years to come. We offer a wide variety of coordinating items that allow you to expand your space as needed, while several casual finishes are available to complement any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fqCgwzHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BQY4PYNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQY4PYNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQY4PYNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
