window.products.push({"id":993183,"name":"WELLAND Jackson 3-Tier Jute Rope Hanging Shelf Wood Floating Shelves Swing Storage Shelves Rustic Home Wall Decor with 2 Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TQOi3GgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material:The shelf is made of wood and finished with charred technique by which the wood grain was revealed. Torched wood is the unique technique of wood finish, very attractive and eye-catching.The rope is made of hemp. There is no varnish coating on surface. Hanging Shelves for Plant: great for small space to hang plants, keeping your plants out of reach from cat. It holds a large aloe plant, succulents etc on the shelf. Big and Adjustable: Wood shelf is 17\" in length, 8\" in width, 0.6\" in thickness; and jute rope is 10.5FT in length, large and thick enough, can be adjusted by moving the knots and DIY single tier, 2-tier or 3-tier for yourself.You can easily disassemble it and DIY for yourself or if not well-balanced, you can adjust its rope length slightly. Easily Mounted:These rustic wood hanging shelves with rope are easy to hang. Just hang from a hook. It has no speical requirement in installing so it could be placed anywhere as there is a litttle bit room. Strung by twisted jute rope, it looks antique and sturdy. Really a good decoration for those who love decorating house with artistic items What’s Included – You will receive a 3-tier reclaimed wood and jute rope hanging shelves(with 2 hooks). Each wooden board measures 17 inches Length x8 inches Width All our shelves are inspected before final packaging to ensure the highest of quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TQOi3GgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLAND","source_asin":"B07TGHC1KJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TGHC1KJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TGHC1KJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
