window.products.push({"id":993191,"name":"Dress My Cupcake Indiana State Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rMy654HEL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Dress My Cupcake is the world's largest manufacturer of dessert table supplies and couture party decor. Our best selling product line includes designer cupcake wrappers, tissue paper pom poms, cupcake stands, cake pop supplies, crystals, vintage straws, washi tape, glitter ribbon, dessert sticks, DIY wooden cutlery kits, and so much more. Dress My Cupcake offers designer cupcake wrappers in over 500 colors and styles, that provide an elegant look to your cupcakes by hiding wrinkly cupcake liners. Dress My Cupcake products have been used to create festive candy buffets and dessert tables at all types of special events, including weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, birthdays, college events, bar and bat mitzvahs, corporate events, Hollywood galas and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rMy654HEL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dress My Cupcake","source_asin":"B00BFDG8MA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BFDG8MA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BFDG8MA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993192,"name":"DeLonghi Metropolis DBM8150 Blender","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5YW2N5ML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Delonghi Metropolis Blender has a Unique Metropolis design with chrome accents complements any kitchen décor. It has a Lid with Removable Ingredient Cap. The durable, sealed lid has three positions: locked, open to pour and open to remove. Remove the cap to easily add ingredients. The Dual Safe System a De'Longhi exclusive, this system is equipped with an automatic safety device that shuts down the motor if the glass jar is removed from the base or if the lid is removed during operation. Removable Stainless Steel Blade Assembly for easy cleaning. Amazon.com The capacious DeLonghi Metropolis blender is a powerful and handsome machine suited to crushing ice and blending drinks, smoothies, and soups. Set on a heavy flared base with rubber grip feet for stability, the blender offers three powerful speeds with an optional pulse function, and a built-in ice crushing function that alternates between on and off for added efficiency. The dial control and speed gauge are easy to use--though the grip is made of a surprisingly light plastic for the heft of the rest of the machine. The Metropolis' jar is formed from heavy-duty glass, marked with metric and imperial measurements, and fitted with a smooth arched handle. Designed to resist scratching and discoloration, the jar holds up to 50 ounces at a time. It stands stably on the countertop, pours smoothly from its tapered spout, and drops into place on the base-no need for twisting it into position. A clever feeding tray nestles into the jar's removable lid, allowing for the tidy addition of ingredients while the machine is running. For extra safety during operation, the blender includes a dual shut-off system that cuts power if the jar or lid is removed or is not in the correct position. The stainless steel blade assembly removes to simplify cleanup, and the base wipes down easily. A combination of matte charcoal, black, and chrome-colored accents, the blender has a stylish appearance suited to the modern kitchen or bar. It stands approximately 17 inches high with the feeder tray in place and carries a one-year warranty from DeLonghi. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5YW2N5ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0001B4T1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001B4T1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001B4T1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
