window.products.push({"id":993199,"name":"LVKH Shower Caddies - No Drill Adhesive Bathroom Shelf - (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMRl1I0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LVKH ADHESIVE BATHROOM SHELVES Conveniently organize your toiletries with the LVKH steel 2-Piece Bathroom Shelf Set. The shelves provide useful depth and width for holding many bathroom essentials, and they come in handy for anything if you want to use this in your kitchen pantry. Made of durable yet lightweight stainless steel, the bathroom shelves offer handiness, utility, and reliable, long lasting strength. From having a ton of items to organize or just a few, the Adhesive Bathroom Shelf Set by LVKH makes a useful addition to any bathroom or kitchen pantry. DETAILS -2 Pack Shelves -9.25 Inches by 5.75 Inches by 6 Inches -Holds up to 13 pounds -Durable Rust proof Steel -Detachable Design -Damage Free Adhesive -Backed by LVKH Limited 1-year Warranty EASY TO INSTALL When this arrives, the Adhesive Bathroom Shelf Set offers easy installation. The shelves stick onto the wall. The Adhesive sticker means you don't need a drill. The sticker means no holes in the wall. (The stickers are designed to be placed on a flat smooth surface. Do not place these over ceramic seams) 2 SHELVES The set provides two pieces so you can use it for one bathroom or two. With two shelves, you can easily get handy shelves for any bathroom or kitchen pantry for organizing your stuff. DRILL FREE ADHESIVE WALL ATTACHMENT Each shelf comes with an easy to attach sticker which is made to stick to walls for years. The stickers provide a secure fit to the wall. No need to install to a wall by drilling holes and using screws. Conveniently use these storage containers without damaging your walls. SPACE-SAVING STORAGE Both Shelves can be placed next to each other or in two different bathrooms. One can be put in your kitchen and one in your garage. With the shelf system you can save space in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMRl1I0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LVKH EST. 2018","source_asin":"B07DNHSZHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNHSZHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNHSZHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
