window.products.push({"id":993215,"name":"HUIMO Ottoman with Storage, 41-inch Upholstered Fabric Storage Ottoman with Safety Hinge, Storage Bench with Button-Tufted, Ottoman Bench for Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rXhu0Us1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE STORAGE & MUTI-PURPOSE】The large volume of this ottoman is enough to meet your various needs. this ottoman bench can easily hide all the messy things, and you can put this bedroom bench at the end of bed to store blankets and pillows, this storage ottoman can also be used as a toy box, and can also be used in various scenes such as entryway and utility rooms. This storage footstool works great as shoe bench, footstool, window bench, bed stool, toy chest, coffee table, puppy step, etc. 【METICULOUS DESIGN】The buttons and neat stitching on the tufted fabric lid give this storage ottoman bench an exquisite and luxurious appearance anywhere in the house, enhancing its modern design. The ottoman bottom rivets design increases the sense of texture and luxury without sacrificing any comfort. At the same time, we provide you with a variety of different colors to choose, and you can match them according to your own preferences. 【EXCELLENT MATERIAL】This ottoman bench is made of delicate and soft tufted fabric. Compared to ordinary fabrics, our bed bench fabric is more skin-friendly and easy to clean. You can use it with confidence while it matches your room perfectly. The inside of the footstool is filled with thick high-resilient sponge, which is not easy to deform after long-term sitting, making the whole footstool more durable without sacrificing any comfort. 【FIRM & SECURITY】We always put safety as the first consideration. This ottoman with storage is made of a solid wood frame, which can hold up to 300 pounds of weight (static load capacity). The inside of this storage ottoman is connected by safety pressure hinges and sturdy hardware accessories. They can keep the lid always open to prevent the bench from closing suddenly, or they can gently and slowly fall when you want to close the lid, so as to ensure that you are safer and more convenient. 【WORRY-FREE ASSEMBLY】Get wonderful time by simple assembly! This bench with storage can be installed in only 5 minutes. Each ottoman bench will be equipped with a tool kit, including an operating manual and connecting parts required. Customer satisfaction is our top priority. While we provide you with high quality products, we also provide you with impeccable customer service that exceeds the highest industry standards. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rXhu0Us1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUIMO","source_asin":"B09LD8CMFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LD8CMFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LD8CMFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
