window.products.push({"id":993330,"name":"Kitchen Supply 13 Inch x 17 Inch Parchment Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519x-61xMzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description From Kitchen Supply, Super Parchment, the incredible Never-Stick Baking Liner. No need to grease the pan. Even the stickiest, most delicate cookies slide off easily without breaking or tearing. 13-inch by 17-inch sheets can be cut to fit any size pan. Washable and reusable hundreds of times. Kitchen Supply Super Parchment is ready to use without additional preparation in most cases. It can be used either side up. No greasing is necessary. Super Parchment can be used in microwave and conventional ovens and the cooking time is not affected. For cookies, place the Super Parchment on the cookie sheet and place the cookie dough directly on the Super Parchment. Do not grease. If necessary, cut to size so that the Super Parchment Paper does not come over the edges of the pan being used. Easily slip the baked cookies off the sheet when ready. For cakes and brownies, line a square or rectangular baking pan with Super Parchment Paper by putting it on the bottom of the pan and carefully folding up the corners and sides. Allow at least 10 minutes to cool before turning out onto a cooling rack and peeling off the Super Parchment. For Pancakes, Super Parchment Paper can be used directly on large pancake griddles by pouring the batter onto the Super Parchment. Make sure the sheet does not stick out from the edge of the griddle. Cut to size if necessary. To clean, wipe with a damp sponge or paper towel. It can also be wash more thoroughly with detergent and water. Super Parchment Paper is not damaged by boiling water or soaps. Additional Care and Use Instructions: 1. Do Not expose to temperatures in excess of 550 degrees F. 2. Do Not expose to open flames, hot burners, gas or charcoal grill surfaces. 3. Do Not use sharp or metal utensils. 4. Do not cut ON the Super Parchment. 5. Do Not allow the Super Parchment to exceed the size of the pan being used. Amazon.com Make any baking sheet nonstick with Super Parchment, a silicone-coated nonstick liner that provides the optimum baking surface. Used with either side up, the Super Parchment works well in conventional or microwave ovens and on large pancake griddles. It requires no greasing or buttering and easily releases cookies, cakes, meringues, and anything else that may stick to the cooking surface. Wipe clean with a damp sponge or paper towel, fold it for easy storage, and use it again and again. --Jane DePaolo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519x-61xMzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Stone Oven","source_asin":"B00004RKFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RKFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RKFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
