window.products.push({"id":993366,"name":"LYART 4Pcs Premium Sink Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink Caddy Brush - SUS304 Stainless Steel Waterproof Rustproof Quick Drying Strong Self Adhesive (1.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qG6KMPUiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Premium Sink Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink Caddy Brush - SUS304 Stainless Steel Waterproof Rustproof Quick Drying Strong Self Adhesive   Size: 1.97 x 1.97 x 1.33 inch Material: SUS304 Stainless Steel Load bearing: Up to 8 pounds Attractive Durable: The kitchen sink sponge holder is made of SUS304 stainless steel and strong adhesive tape, can bear 8 pounds. The surface is protected by a blue protective film. Please tear it off before use. Multifunctional design: The sink caddy sponge holder can be used to hang sponge, caddy, brush, small pot lid, cutting board, dishcloth, sink stopper, spatula etc. The open design allows the water to drain. The sponge dries quickly in the sink without leaving external sundries. Waterproof and rustproof: Because of its waterproof and rustproof properties, you can use it in the kitchen, bathroom and other places. You don't have to worry about it rusting or falling off. Save Storage Space: The sponge holder will not take much space when you are washing dishes or vegetables. Small design but multi-functional. Easy installation: Step1: Wipe clean and keep dry. Step2: Remove the surface protective film.（Silver products have protective film）Step3: Peel off the protective layer and stick it on the desired position. Step4: Use 24 hours later for better adhesion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qG6KMPUiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYART","source_asin":"B09QJS9GFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QJS9GFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QJS9GFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
