window.products.push({"id":993372,"name":"Digging Dolls: 1 lb Rainbow Fluorite Trimmings from China - Natural Raw Crystals and Stones for Arts, Crafts, Tumbling, Cabbing, Polishing, Wire Wrapp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OdF+vXHOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and value with the most spectacular 100% natural stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.This beautiful Rainbow Fluorite is mined in a large quarry in China then cut into shapes such as spheres, bears, and other animals. What you are purchasing are the trimmings cut away from around the edges during the carving process of this premium fluorite. These breathtaking stones are captivating and can be used for arts, crafts, home decor, decoration, tumbling, gem mining, fountains, wire wrapping, jewelry making, reiki and more. Once you have the stones in your hands the innovative thoughts for their uses just spring to mind!About Digging Dolls Stone Pictures: To ensure your satisfaction all Digging Dolls images show random stones right out of the mine bags. We have noticed many other stone dealers hand select and picture only perfect stones then what is received is not at all close to what is pictured. We believe in letting you see the most accurate representation of the stones (short of taking pictures of every order which would be cost prohibitive). Due to this some stones in our pictures may not look flawless, since as natural earth mined stones they are very rarely ever flawless.Every stone is unique and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As natural earth mined stones that formed over millions of years they will vary in size, color, shape and patterning. The colors vary and you may get more of one color or some colors may be completely missing from your bag. The most important thing to Digging Dolls is making sure our customers are thrilled with what they receive when ordering the Digging Dolls brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OdF+vXHOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B01NCWYJ28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCWYJ28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCWYJ28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
