window.products.push({"id":993453,"name":"Sweet Needle Black Cloth Napkins 20 x 20 Pack of 12, 100% Cotton Oversized Heavy Weight Dinner Napkin for Home/Wedding/Party/Cocktail Napkins/Hotel/Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vkl3J6gBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VALUE PACK: These Black Color Napkins Set Contains12 Pieces Premium Cotton Cloth Napkins provides you with enough dinner napkins for all your household needs for today, tomorrow; and the future! With the perfect size of 50 centimeters by 50 centimeters (20 Inches by 20 Inches) square. LONG-LASTING MATERIAL: Manufactured using the 100% natural long staple US Cotton, these dinner napkins are soft, comfortable and absorbent, quick drying, and high in quality! Each napkin is carefully cut and sewn from the finest quality poly cotton fabric with generous hem that comes in your choice of multiple colors to choose from! Durable and wrinkle resistant, these napkins are an eco-friendly alternative to paper towels. COUNTLESS USES – Superior and luxury hotel quality, these dinner napkins are not only good for events and business settings but make great for home settings as well! Use them as hotel napkins, wedding reception napkins, restaurant napkins, banquet table napkins and as party table napkins! Helps to redesign the dinner décor instantaneously! ECO FRIENDLY NAPKINS (GO GREEN): Our Chemical free napkins set is made in BCI compliant and OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, an independent certification system that ensures to meet high safety standard to keep your family safe and healthy. The Oeko-Tex napkin are tested for harmful substances and certified AZO FREE as they come in close contact with the mouth. They are Non-toxic making it soothing for even the most sensitive skin. SweetNeedle Cotton Napkins are reliable and durable. MACHINE WASHABLE OR HAND WASH: All Sweet Needle napkins are easy care. Machine wash on cold water, gentle cycle to reduce the possibility of shrinkage. Wash with like colors. Tumble dry low. NOTE: Due to the natural cotton fabric, some minimal shrinkage may occur. Little Iron required before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vkl3J6gBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SweetNeedle","source_asin":"B095YZWNXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095YZWNXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095YZWNXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
