window.products.push({"id":993483,"name":"i-Water Classic Home 1400 Alkaline Hydrogen Ionizer Pitcher- Naturally Increase pH, Electrolytes, Improve Taste of Any Water (47 fl oz/1400ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lwrp638gL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS ALKALINE WATER: Alkaline water is water that has been ionized which means it is less acidic than regular tap water and is rich in essential compounds such as calcium, potassium, and magnesium. Our ionizer bottle transforms regular water into antioxidant water with a pH of greater than 8.5! | HOW: Hydrogen is produced when water reacts with mineral balls in the filter, removing 90% of chlorine, copper, lead, heavy metals and odors. BENEFITS Neutralizes acidity in the stomach and intestines, has ultra-hydrating properties, maintains healthy bones and reduces damaging free radicals in your body. Alkaline water absorbs quicker in your system hydrating you faster and more effectively than regular filtered or tap water. Get your electrolytes from iwater- not sugary sports drinks! SAVE THE EARTH The cost of bottled water can amount to hundreds of dollars per year, and single-use bottles end up in the trash. Save money and eliminate the use of plastic bottles. Break your plastic addiction while enjoying water that tastes better than store bought! LONG-LASTING FILTER The mineral ball filter has a life expectancy of approximately 1 year if you fill it 4 times a day, or for 1,460 refills. We use the purest minerals, to keep your water clear and not grainy or over saturated with particles. (For 1400 Filter Search: B09WVL5G1F) EASY TO USE Share with your family, and save space! Simply fill up the bottle with either filtered or regular tap water, let it sit for 5 – 10 minutes, and enjoy. Empty chamber located under the filter can house loose tea leaves so that tea can be brewed, if desired | WANT TO TEST PH: Use pH drops or a calibrated meter to test iwater. Most pH test strips are designed to test saliva and urine and are not recommended to test drinking water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lwrp638gL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I","source_asin":"B07K7XRXZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7XRXZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7XRXZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
