window.products.push({"id":993582,"name":"Rissanti Palermo Collection Ottana Zerostrain Recliner, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KHt5VmchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rissanti Palermo Collection features sleek and stylish recliners. The European design makes for a contemporary look for your den or living room. Recline in a single-motion and the leg rest pops-up giving full-body support while relaxing or watching television. The plush upholstered seating, is ultra-durable and features sinuous spring support for added comfort. In the upright position, the recliner is a space-saving chair. The Rissanti Palermo Collection offers perfect recliners with comfort you need and the style you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KHt5VmchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rissanti","source_asin":"B00UJIXACS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UJIXACS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UJIXACS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993583,"name":"MR. ELLIE POOH Handmade Fair Trade Soapstone Yellow Hippo Desk Buddy - Figurine/Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710sY+PYwVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This adorable sculpture was hand-carved out of stone by a fair trade women's cooperative in Kenya called Tabaha. This cooperative was established to eradicate suffering in the Kisi area of Kenya. Mr. Ellie Pooh believes in empowering these artisans by providing fair wages and markets for their products outside Kenya. Soapstone gives an incredible smooth and heavy feel when you hold it. Every sculpture is handcrafted so no two are exactly alike. This soapstone hippo is decorative but can also or paperweight. A great office gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710sY+PYwVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MR. ELLIE POOH","source_asin":"B0122PU758","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0122PU758","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0122PU758","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993584,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. Oversized 6-Piece Quilt Queen Bed in a Bad Set Lightweight Fabric Soft with one Quilt Bedspread, Two Matching Shams and T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A180bLqu9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to update your bedroom with a quality quilt bedding spread without Spending a lot of money? Our 6-Piece full / queen oversized bedding quilt sets fit the bill. These light-weight quilt bedding sets are high-quality, made with extra soft fabric, beautifully embroidered and comes with matching shams and throw pillows. These queen size bedding sets are made with our signature microfiber soft fabric that is light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage free, fade resistant. Full / Queen Size quilt set is a 6-Piece Set with One Quilt: 98 inch wide x 98 inch long and Two Quilted Shams: 20 in wide x 36 in long and three throw pillows (Sizes: Throw Pillow 1: (18 in x 18 in), Throw Pillow 2: (10 in x 20 in), Throw Pillow 3: (15 in diameter)). Shams have an envelope enclosure. These are oversized Quilt ses and made with our signature extra soft brushed microfiber fabric. The three throw Pillows are filled and there is no need to purchase inserts for them. High Quality Craftsmanship & Signature Soft Fabric: Woven with Double-Brushed soft Microfiber yarns, this quilt bedding set will continue to soften with each wash. This Quilt set has tight embroidered stitching. There are so many ways these quilt sets can be used. You can layer it to add depth, or you can simply use it on its own. Perfect for any type of décor, whether it is farmhouse bedding, boho style, or modern décor, this oversized king bedspread will instantly transform your bedroom. Multi-Purpose and versatile: These oversized light-weight quilt sets can be used on their own or as a layer with other bedding. These Twin / twin XL size quilt bedding sets and bedspreads can be used in any type of décor. You can quite easily use them in simply chic urban loft setting, farmhouse bedding, French country décor, bohemian bedding style, or in simple minimalist setting. It comes in vacuum sealed packaging. These Quilts Bedding sets are wrinkle free, fade and pilling Resistant. These coverlet Sets are high-quality and made with our Signature Double-Brushed Luxurious and soft microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness. They are machine washable and will continue to get softer with each wash. The shams require pillow inserts other than that, these bed in a bad quilt bedding sets are ready to. Decorative throw pillows come filled and dont require extra inserts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A180bLqu9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B0BD61HPSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD61HPSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD61HPSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993585,"name":"North Carolina State University Diploma Frame NCSU Graduation Degree Double Matted College Campus Photo Graduation Gift Certificate Plaque Framing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eey7BvheL._AC_SL1332_.jpg","description":"North Carolina State University Diploma Size Info - After you place your order, email us through AchievementGifts (Amazon) or AllGiftFrames and let us know your \"diploma size\" Make sure you let us know the correct diploma size. University Diploma Frame manufacture high quality university diploma frames and certificate frames using state-of-the-art quality control techniques to showcase your achievements. From college or university graduation diploma frames, we appropriately capture & display your certificate degree and university diploma with its memorable beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eey7BvheL._AC_SL1332_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AllGiftFrames","source_asin":"B079WG4JKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079WG4JKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079WG4JKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993586,"name":"THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE: World History in the Making","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":144.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yw1QXYG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Back Cover THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE showcases one of the most important presidential races in American history through the eyes of the world's top photographers. Spanning a two-year period, the book provides behind-the-scenes images encompassing President Barack Obama's road to the White House, Election Day, the Inauguration and his first 100 days in office. Including essays from TIME magazine's Joe Klein, The Huffington Post 's Arianna Huffington, General Colin Powell and President Obama's sister, Auma Obama. The book also includes fascinating infographics from world-renowned graphic artist Nigel Holmes, the human stories featured in this fascinating book capture the challenges and opportunities facing America's 44th president as he takes his place on the world stage. THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE also offers a groundbreaking new feature: After you answer a few simple questions and upload your own photos to the publisher's website, a personalized copy of the book will be created just for you, seamlessly weaving President Obama's extraordinary journey together with your name, your photos and your thoughts. 3 Easy Steps to Create Your Own Personalized Book 1. Purchase a copy of THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE on Amazon.com: an authorization link will be sent to the email address on your Amazon.com account so you can personalize your book. (Please note: The link may take up to 3 hours to arrive in your inbox.) 2. Personalize your book: a custom website will guide you through a simple 10-minute process to add your name and photos. See below for all the fascinating ways you can personalize your book. 3. Receive your personalized copy of THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE in 2-3 weeks. 6 Fun Ways to Personalize Your Book Personalizing your book enables you to weave President Obama's journey with yours in numerous locations throughout the book. A step-by-step guide walks you through the fun and easy steps. 1. Your Name on the Front CoverYou can add your name on the front cover of the book and on the title page as one of the authors. Of course, you also have the option of creating a personalized book as a gift for family members and friends. 2. Your Photo on the Back CoverPreserve this moment in history forever by adding a photo of yourself, your family, a group of friends, or an event (Go Obama!) on the back cover of this extraordinary book. Upload a favorite digital photo, and in seconds the publisher’s website will show you what your image will look like on the back cover. 3. Personalized Dedication THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE includes a Dedication page, which allows you to inscribe the book to someone special. You can also add a personal Dedication message. For example, you might want to write about what the election meant to you or why you've made a personalized edition of the book in someone's honor. 4. Your Name on the Inaugural Invitation PageWhether you were invited to the Inauguration or watched it from afar, you can enjoy seeing your name engraved on the book's Inaugural Invitation page. 5. Your Photo on the Celebrity Supporters PageOprah Winfrey, George Clooney, Jennifer Lopez, Bruce Springsteen, and many other celebrities helped get the word out to support the Obama campaign. Your photo and name can be right next to them on the Celebrity Supporters page. 6. Your Child's Artwork on the Kids for Obama PageDid your child draw pictures of Obama for a school project? Even if not, it's not too late. Get out the crayons and have him or her draw a picture of the First Family, then scan and upload the drawing. Your child's artwork will be preserved forever when you add it to this heartwarming page. Non-Personalized, Standard Books Available If you are not interested in personalizing a book, you can order a standard edition. THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE is filled with fascinating photographs and thoughtful essays about President Obama's historic journey to the White House. A Look Inside THE OBAMA TIME CAPSULE (Click on Images to Enlarge) Candidate Obama speaking in rally at University of Mary Washington, Fredericksburg, VA, September 27,2008 President Obama and First Lady Michelle Obama at the Youth Inaugural Ball, January 20, 2009. Among the tens of thousands who lined the Inaugural parade route, a few peeking out from the facade of the Treasury Department building. Candidate Obama engulfed by supporters after delivering a campaign speech in St. Paul, Minnesota, June 1, 2008. Ordering and Return Policy For ordering a personalized or standard book. After purchasing the book on Amazon.com, an authorization link will be emailed to you so you can personalize your book. (Please note: The email link may take up to 3 hours to arrive in your inbox.) The link takes you to the publisher's website, which will guide you through the simple steps to personalize your book. &amp;amp;amp;lt;!-- /* Font Definitions */ @font-face {font-family:\"Cambria Math\"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4; mso-font-alt:\"Calisto MT\"; mso-font-charset:0; mso-generic-font-family:ro","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yw1QXYG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Against All Odds Productions","source_asin":"B0025VKZ02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0025VKZ02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0025VKZ02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
