window.products.push({"id":993617,"name":"JML Comforter Set, 3 Pieces Queen Comforter Set with 2 Pillow Shams - Lightweight Farmhouse Creasing Technique Vintage Quilted Design, All Season Down","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Bzh9KK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FARMHOUSE VINTAGE CRESTS – JML Queen comforter bedding set measures 90 inches by 90 inches with 2 pillow shams 26 inches by 20 inches. The soft-brushed outer layer of the comforter set is specially processed with our unique creasing technique to bring you the embellishments that adorn your room with a warm vintage look. DURABLE QUILTED DESIGN – To prevent the premium down-alternative filling from shifting, 3 layers of the comforter are tightly quilted with ultra-strength thread line to create the classy square patterns across the comforter. LIGHTWEIGHT BUT WARM – With 2 layers of 90GSM soft-brushed microfiber surface and 250GSM of warm filling. Not too thin nor too thick to be used all year, great for a relaxing daytime nap or a cosy night's sleep ECO-FRIENDLY PACKAGING –We used a vacuum package to protect the product from, dust, moisture, etc. in shipping or storage, It may leave some wrinkles on the product, Don't need to wash before using like other comforters, simply tumble dry with the dryer sheets(which are included in our package) for 20-30 minutes and you can get a fluffy and soft comforter to enjoy a good night's sleep! EASY CARE - Machine wash in cold water, gentle cycle and tumble dry low with dryer sheets. Do not bleach. Do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Bzh9KK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JML","source_asin":"B0C53GNZ7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C53GNZ7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C53GNZ7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
