window.products.push({"id":993625,"name":"Moon Phase Garland with Chains Boho Hanging Ornaments Moon Hang Art Room Decor for Wedding Home Office Nursery Room Dorm (Golden B, Medium)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515PpZYryAL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"\" Ancient Greek mythology: In ancient Greek mythology, Artemis, Zeus's most beloved daughter, one of the twelve gods of Olympus in Greece, is the goddess who rules the moon, at the same time, she is a goddess of hunting, nature, fertility, and birth. Therefore, many meaningful symbols about the moon extend, such as women, beauty, reproduction, life, love, marriage, harvest, purity, the power of nature, mystery, gentleness, and so on. Adorn your life: The different shapes of moons bring more possibilities to your home or office decoration, the fascinating moon-hanging garland will never go out of style, it's what the art and warmth are about, this moon bohemia wall decor will bring you a romantic bohemian style. Specifications: Chains material: copper with gold electroplated Moons material: stainless steel with gold electroplated Packages list: Long-chain X 1 Short-chain x 9 Moon Phases X 9 Seamless hook X 2 Expansion tubes X 4 How to use it? The product you will receive is a semi-DIY product. You need to use the opening jump rings to connect the small round hole on the moon phase with the chain. The installation process is very simple and fast and can be completed in 5 minutes. There is no fixed answer to the arrangement of the moon phases, and we provide 9 chains in different lengths to fit 9 pieces of moon phases, so you can DIY your favorite style according to your preferences. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515PpZYryAL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zayee","source_asin":"B08RCT7SKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RCT7SKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RCT7SKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
