window.products.push({"id":993758,"name":"Birthday Graduation Retirement Celebration 2 Line Custom Text 24\"x51\" Birthday Decorations For Boys Personalized Large Vinyl Banner Multi Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e10mszr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customized celebration banners make excellent milestone birthday party decor, anniversary party decor, graduation party decor, and much more. DESIGN: The front of the wall vinyl banner is printed with the design pictured and features a smooth surface that can be used indoors or outdoors. SIZE: This vinyl banner features an overall measurement of 24\" wide by 51\" long (unrolled). The vinyl banner measures 24\" wide by 1.5\" tall (rolled up) for compact and easy storage. FEATURES: The pictured design is printed across the entire front using a fade-resistant printing process. The vinyl banner is easy to install with the included .5\" grommets in each corner.This custom gift is made to your exact specifications. USEAGE: Vinyl banners are so versatile and can be used as a happy birthday banner, congratulations banner, grand opening banner for store or business, birth announcement banner, yard sale banner makes a great idea for baby showers, birthday gifts for women, preschool teacher gifts, or makes a perfect room decor for home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e10mszr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Gifts","source_asin":"B08LM5V5KW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LM5V5KW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LM5V5KW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993759,"name":"Magnetic Fireplace Cover Indoor for Insulation, Black Fireplace Blocker Blanket with Strong Magnets and Hidden Hanging Rings to Keep Out Cold, Firepla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OgrI+gsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 ENERGY SAVINGS: Helps prevent drafts, odors and debris from entering your home through a fireplace or wood stove. In winter, fireplace blockers stop heat loss, keep you warm and reduce heating costs. In summer, it can block the loss of cold air, block the heat outside, and the air conditioner consumes less power, which truly achieves the purpose of saving energy and saving money. 🔥 HIGH QUALITY: Our fireplace cover is made of high quality thickened flame retardant oxford cloth, filled with high-quality sponge, the split line prevents the inner lining from moving, 3 invisible rings are designed, equipped with 4 strong magnets, so that the fireplace blanket can be tightly attached to the fireplace, effectively blocking the outdoor cold / hot air and achieving thermal insulation effect. 🔥 STRONG MAGNET COMBINED WITH HANGING HOLE DESIGN: Our fireplace draft stopper uses a combination of 4 powerful magnets and 3 sturdy hidden hanging rings, the suction force of a single magnet reaches 1.2T, strong adsorption without falling, the black color makes it blend in with the fireplace, you won't even notice it because the magnets are not heat resistant. So don't put the magnet in a high temperature environment for a long time, otherwise the magnet will reduce its magnetic performance. 🔥 INSTALLATION & STORAGE: You can use strong magnets to install or mounting with magnets and invisible rings, two installation methods, more practical. The magnet can move left and right to fit your fireplace frame well, more suitable. We are equipped with instructions, please select the appropriate installation method according to the instructions before use. Our fireplace blocker blanket is easy to fold and store when not in use without taking up a lot of space. 🔥 PACKAGE INCLUDES: You will receive a 45 x 34 inch fireplace cover, 4 strong magnets, 3 metal hooks, 8 sets of screws, and an installation manual. Tip: In order to prolong the life of the fireplace blanket, it is recommended to use it after the open fire in the fireplace is extinguished. Due to its large size, it is vacuum packed. Please open the package and hang it in a ventilated place 24 hours before use. It will return to normal thickness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OgrI+gsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"whumsdog","source_asin":"B0BNQB97RN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQB97RN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQB97RN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
