window.products.push({"id":993788,"name":"Electrolux El8907A Nimble Brushroll Clean Bagless Upright Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bHbN4djOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Electrolux Nimble Brushroll Clean (EL8907A) vacuum boasts a multi-cyclonic system that will reduce clogging and filter wear, while never losing suction. The sealed air system and odor absorbing filter ensure that dust, dirt and odors stay in the collection bin and aren’t returned to the air in the users home. Equipped with an adjustable multipurpose attachment head and independent brushroll control, users can switch between carpets, hardwood, stairs and crevices without slowing down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bHbN4djOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Electrolux","source_asin":"B00H2R88Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H2R88Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H2R88Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993789,"name":"CAROMIO Yarn-Dyed Geometric Jacquard Duvet Cover Set King Size - 100% Cotton, 3PCS Embroidery Shabby Chic Farmhouse Bedding Set - Ivory/Black, 104x92 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DI9X514-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Pre-Washed Cotton: Our 100% selected natural cotton duvet cover set creates a crisp, natural, and cozy sleeping environment for you and your family. The pre-washed process ensures excellent softness, and the fabric gets even softer with repeated washing. The remaining tiny plant particles lend a natural special look to the duvet cover like no others. Unique Clipped Jacquard Texture: Our clipped jacquard duvet cover set introduces a soft texture and eye-catching dimension to your bedroom decor. The clip jacquard and eyelash look woven geometric pattern contrasts with the base fabric, presenting a bohemian geometric pattern on the duvet cover set. The rich textured advantage and vibrant colors will remain through years of washing. Hidden Button Closure and Secure Corner Ties: Our delicate and durable hidden button closure at the foot of the duvet cover allows you to place a padded insert (NOT included) within the duvet cover. And four internal corner ties help to prevent it from shifting, keeping it secure and comfortable all night long. Easy to Care: Our cotton jacquard duvet cover set is machine washable separately in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Iron on the lowest setting as needed. Do not dry clean. Our duvet cover set is easy to care for, making it a convenient choice for your bedding needs. What You Will Get: Our 3pcs king size clipped jacquard duvet cover set includes one duvet cover and two pillowcases. The duvet cover measures 104 Inches (W) x 92 Inches (L), while each pillowcase measures 20 Inches (W) x 36 Inches (L). The insert is NOT included, making it a perfect gift for Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DI9X514-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAROMIO","source_asin":"B09NBY5FWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBY5FWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBY5FWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993790,"name":"Walldecor1 Brown Wood Grain Contact Paper Self Adhesive Shelf Liner for Kitchen Cabinets Countertops Drawer Furniture Sticker 15.7\" x 78.7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gS4N-V4vL._AC_SL1098_.jpg","description":"Renovating your cabinet, countertop, furniture table etc Just need purchase one roll contact paper, then stick the contact paper to flat place you want, it can make them looks like new one. Instruction for Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet, drawer, walls, window, glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is better. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out. Note: Please buy enough roll paper one time to avoid the effect of batch color difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gS4N-V4vL._AC_SL1098_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walldecor1","source_asin":"B07G6H25KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G6H25KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G6H25KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
