window.products.push({"id":993799,"name":"French Lavender Sachets for Drawers and Closets Fresh Scents, Home Fragrance Sachet, Pack of 24, Purple, LV-S-C-24-1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819IKn23bkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SACHETS WITH DRIED LAVENDER FLOWER: Dried lavender flower buds, hand-filled craft cute lavender sachets, most delightful and aromatic fragrance of lavender. RELEASE STRONG LAVENDER SCENT: With dried lavender flower buds, the scent and fragrance of lavender can get weak (oil evaporated) easily after a while, but the scent of lavender still exists in the flower buds. The right and best way to refresh fragrance of lavender is to dab or even try to crush the flower buds a little with just your hands and fingers. It would instantly release the most aromatic fragrance of lavender in the air. And this can last for months at least! IDEAL FOR DRAWERS AND CLOSETS: Best uses for closets, drawers, gym bags, cars, linen closets, suitcase, pillows, and storage bins or hanging in wardrobes. Dried French lavender buds have a delightful scent. Lavender is a great relaxant as well. It has been used for insomnia, anxiety, depression and to lift your mood. WHAT’S INCLUDED: 24 purple lavender flower sachets - handmade pre-filled sachets, packaged in a durable and easily resealable craft bag. Shake the bag or squeeze the sachets a little before use - release the lavender fragrance. ABOUT US: Lavande Sur Terre offers dried lavender buds with a highland lavender scent and stunning appearance, retaining their fresh fragrance and color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819IKn23bkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavande Sur Terre","source_asin":"B0B9BLC9T5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BLC9T5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BLC9T5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
