window.products.push({"id":993834,"name":"Rainbow Stainless Steel Straws Set of 10, Reusable Metal Straws with 8 Silicone Tips and 2 Cleaner Brush, for 30oz 20oz Tumblers, Long Drinking Straws","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uxXHArfzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>[Package Includes] - 2 x 10.5\" straight straws (diameter 0.24 inch), 2 x 10.5\" bent straws (diameter 0.24 inch), 2 x 8.5\" straight straws (diameter 0.24 inch), 2 x 8.5\" bent straws (diameter 0.24 inch), 2 x 8.5\" straight smoothie straws (diameter 0.47 inch), 1 x cotton travel bag, 2 x cleaning brush, 8 x silicone straw tips</p> <p>[Eco-friendly Material] - These metal straws reusable are made of food grade 18/8 (304) stainless steel material. No metal aftertaste, plastic free, BPA free, dishwasher safe, reusable, durable and environmentally friendly. The straws reusable stainless steel are the natural choice for everyone. It can replace hundreds or thousands of plastic straws, reducing pollution</p> <p>[Easy To Clean] - Each package come with 2 free special scrub brushes. Featuring a stainless steel handle and nylon bristles, the brush is special designed the perfect size for these metal straws for drinks. To clean the stainless steel straws, just need to insert the banister brush in the straw and rotate gently. No worry of any fruit or small pieces of food left over or stuck in the straws</p> <p>[Silicone Straw Tips] - The silicone tips is top food grade silicone material, no BPA. They are removable and easy to clean. They keep your lips from getting too cold or too hot and protect your teeth and lips from chipping. There are 4 different silicone top colors to serve as identifiers for your family</p> <p>[Portable & Multi Functional] - Modern and sleek design, with the Cotton and Linen Material bag, both of them are light weight and handy, which are easy to carry out in your bag. Compact and portable, easy to store and carry. These portable metal straws look equally beautiful in a smoothie, which add fun to any party, trendy for family reunion, cocktail party, picnics, boating and perfect for you to enjoy your cold beverage, coffee, lemonade, ice tea, cappuccino, milkshake</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uxXHArfzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYMYNB","source_asin":"B092ZHML34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092ZHML34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092ZHML34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
