window.products.push({"id":993880,"name":"American Atelier 16 Piece Round Dinnerware Set, Indigo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812iqyShj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring bright delight to your daily meals with this eye-popping, American Atelier 16 piece dinnerware set (full service for four). the durable construction is great for everyday use, while the contemporary design is pretty enough to display. The unique construction makes it a perfect way to accentuate all your dinner parties, home bar or buffet. For nearly any occasion, this American Atelier dinnerware set will make a stunning addition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812iqyShj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Atelier","source_asin":"B06XHMCJRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHMCJRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHMCJRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":993881,"name":"Knife Sharpener for Straight and Serrated Knives,2-Stage Stainless Steel Ceramic and Tungsten - Easy Manual Sharpening Quickly and Safe for Dull Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b4KSgAH7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Professional Knife Sharpening System What makes our knife sharpener one of the most innovative kitchen tools you’ll ever own?  First, and unlike other knife sharpeners, it has a two-slot system that both files and polishes all blade sizes and types.  This means you can use it for every knife you own. It maintains the sharpness of your knives for much longer than your average sharpener. INSTRUCTIONS: 1. Place the knife sharpener on a flat surface. 2. Hold the knife sharpener by the stainless steel rod. 3. For a very dull knife, hold the knife by the handle and pull it along the coarse slot toward you 4 to 16 times depending on how dull the knife is. 4. Move the knife to the fine slot and pull it toward you until it is as sharp as desired.  It can take as little as 4 pulls or for very dull knives up to 55 pulls. This is to polish the blade off and to hone the knife. It will be VERY sharp, so be careful. 5. Wipe with a dry cloth to clean. CAUTIONS: 1.Always rest your sharpener on a sturdy flat surface, never on our leg, and keep fingers behind finger guard to avoid injury occurring. 2.Pull the knife in one direction only.Do not move backward and forward. This innovative designed and engineered sharpening system is a cut above the traditional V sharpener and designed for all types of knives, from your standard kitchen knife to your utility or pocket knife. STAGE 1 (Coarse) uses Tungsten grinder blades to re-shape your knife, restoring the dullest, damaged knives back into shape. Tungsten is one of the strongest metals in existence. STAGE 2 (Fine) is a pair of Ceramic rounded blades to give your blades a smooth edge and create a fine honed sharpness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b4KSgAH7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HONASI","source_asin":"B07TY44QY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY44QY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY44QY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
