window.products.push({"id":993943,"name":"GYUTEI Electric Power Lift Recliner Chairs for Elderly with Massage and Heat,PU Leather Recliner Sofa Lift Chair with 2 Cup Holders,2 Side Pockets,USB","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":429.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Fj-FnMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWER LIFT DESIGN--If you’re looking for a recliner for the elderly or those with chronic leg, hip, and back pain,GYUTEI Lift Recliner is a great option.Just press the button on the outside of the right handrail to recline and open up for the perfect lounging position(between 45-160 degrees).The motor can also help people stand easily without any effort on the knees and waist. STEADY AND DURABLE--Non-formaldehyde-free environmentally friendly wood protects the health of the elderly who choose our lift chairs. The sturdy metal frame has undergone 25.000 non-destructive tests and can bear 370 LBS.The speed of lifting is also relatively slow, preventing your old parents from falling during use and we also added a thoughtful anti-back-tipping design to escort your safety. HEATING AND MASSAGE FUNCTION--Our electric recline chair has a massage function and a separate heating system for the lumbar.The recliner chair offers 8 massage points of the neck, lumbar,thigh,and legs.You can use the remote controller to chose 5 massage methods and 2 intensities to promote circulation and reinvigorate tired muscles while you nap, read, or watch TV. (please note: This chair provides vibration massage not Shiatsu massage) FRIENDLY DESIGN--This versatile reclining chair features 2 cup holders, 2 side pockets, and a USB port that you can use to charge your mobile devices. The removable cup holder can take out and is easy to clean. When you are thirsty or your phone is out of power, you can get the water or charge your phone without getting up. EASY TO CLEAN AND ASSEMBLE--The surface of this massage chair is made of PU leather,which is breathable and easy to clean, clean with a dry or damp lint-free cloth.It takes only several steps to assemble the lift chair,with an instruction manual inside and NO extra tools are needed. If there is any problem with the item, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it for you in the first time.Notice:The item comes in two boxes and may not arrive at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Fj-FnMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GYUTEI","source_asin":"B0BDFXF5NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFXF5NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFXF5NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
