window.products.push({"id":993955,"name":"Switol Manual Citrus Juicer, Commercial Hand Orange juice Squeezer, Suitable for Many Fruit such as Lemon, Lime, Grapefruit, Pomegranate etc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vKfxgyEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our industrial heavy duty lever juicer is perfect for restaurants, grocery stores, bars, fruit shops it’s also a great gift for family or friends who love to make healthy fresh juice regularly and frequently. Feature - Quickly and Easily Juicing You can squeeze a glass of juice within 2 minutes. Just cut the citrus into half ( not require peeling ), put the flat side down on the strainer and press the handle. - Lifetime Use Our hand operated Juicer is made up of stainless steel and cast iron with rust-proof coating and it can last for many years. - More Delicious Juice Our juicer can squeezing best tasting juice instead of rind taste that other juice machines would give you. The built-in strainer cup catches all seeds but let some pulp through. If you don’t like fruit flesh in your juice, you could easily add a wire strainer step to your process. Space Required Height: 15.5” for storing 28.5” for operating Length: 11.5” for storing 16.5” for operating Width: 7.25” Using Instructions 1. Clean the citrus press carefully before first use.2. Check the stainless steel screws. If screws loose, please tighten it carefully with the wrenches which are part of the delivery.3. Using the fruit juicer on stable ground.4. Insert the funnel into the juice press. then insert the screen and place a glass under the funnel.5. Cut the fruits in half, put one half on the screen, move down the lever arm slowly until all juice is squeezed out.6. After long use, tightening the screws, and oil the shaft and joints with any kitchen oil. Notice Juicer press will tilt forward if you apply force to the handle for juicing citrus, so you need put one hand on the back at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vKfxgyEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"switol","source_asin":"B01IV46GBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-993955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IV46GBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IV46GBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
